{"id":"vod_zy360_66453","vodId":"66453","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"强风吹拂","name_cn":"强风吹拂","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全23集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241022-1/d1a41c292f1baae6fb25f840d51b99bb.jpg"},"summary":"藏原走（大冢刚央配音）是一名性格非常内向的大学一年级男生，不善言辞的他总是习惯用跑步来抒发内心里的情感波动。一天深夜，正在跑步的阿走遇见了名叫清濑灰二（丰永利行配音）的男子，这个散发着独特魅力的男人主动向阿走搭话，并且向阿走介绍了他所居住的名为竹青庄的公寓。就这样，阿走在半推半就之下成为了竹青庄的第10名住户。虽然日常打打闹闹但相互非常信赖的城太郎兄弟、被称之为神童，但阿走却觉得他有些古怪的杉山高志（内山昂辉配音）、热衷于看电视猜谜节目的坂口洋平（北泽力配音）、性格轻浮却异常讨厌烟味的高材生岩仓雪彦（兴津和幸配音），和阿走共享着这幢破旧的公寓的，是这些性格稀奇古怪的人们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-22 14:51:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/7W1ggTB2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/wsMWmmAZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/5rKbO0R2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/FMGFyqUm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/PftTN4nm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/G75Py3fE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/QYMuJBm0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/nKzHk0KW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/mdPStjfZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/yifVkNBS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/zNXvgIuX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/SbEWz2PF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/nMIiZ8AP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/kQDVEToB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241021/ScIJ1G2Q/